1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,920
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:25,080
This smell...

3
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,280
is exactly the same as twenty years ago.

4
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,560
Ling Yunfei.

5
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:45,120
Are you going to talk or not?

6
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:04,320
I, Ling Yunfei,

7
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,000
hate informers more than anything.

8
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:14,240
Execute him.

9
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:21,880
-Kill him!
-Kill him!

10
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:31,120
-Good!
-Good!

11
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,200
Good riddance!

12
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,520
The traitor has been executed.

13
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,720
Let's report back to His Majesty.

14
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:47,440
Meng Tinghui fulfilled her
military pledge on time

15
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,840
and destroyed the Tiger's Roar Gang.

16
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:50,000
She has not disappointed me.

17
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,400
As for the rest,

18
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:52,760
proceed as you proposed.

19
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,680
I obey.

20
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,600
Shen Zhishu.

21
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,680
At your service.

22
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,200
In capturing the Tiger's Roar Gang

23
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,640
and investigating the Blood Moon Society,
you rendered repeated service.

24
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:06,320
I hereby promote you
to fourth-rank Censor.

25
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,680
You will take charge of the
Blood Moon Society case.

26
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,280
I also grant you a
frontier mobilization order

27
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,360
to reinforce Qingzhou.

28
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:12,080
If you find proof of treason,

29
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,240
you may execute first
and report afterward.

30
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,080
I thank Your Majesty for this great favor.

31
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,480
I will devote myself completely

32
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,920
and not fail Your Majesty.

33
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:22,840
Rise.

34
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,560
Your Majesty, I have
completed my investigation.

35
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,400
The Blood Moon Society,
founded by Zhongwan loyalists,

36
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:29,440
has operated under the
cover of Huiyin House

37
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,400
and lain hidden in the capital for years,

38
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:32,480
drawing many high officials
and nobles to its side.

39
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:34,800
Its ambition to restore Zhongwan is plain.

40
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,320
We are now pursuing its remaining members.

41
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:37,240
Your Majesty.

42
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:40,600
I once campaigned against
Zhongwan with the late Emperor.

43
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,040
I beg Your Majesty

44
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,200
to let me lead elite troops

45
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:45,080
and eradicate the remnants of Zhongwan.

46
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,520
At my age,

47
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:49,400
if I can die in battle
serving Your Majesty,

48
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,680
I will have no regrets.

49
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,520
Blindly suppressing them by force

50
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,120
will only deepen the hatred.

51
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:57,280
Besides, Qingzhou's northern
border adjoins Beijian.

52
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,760
If that sparks both internal
and external unrest,

53
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,480
the people will be the ones who suffer.

54
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,240
Your Majesty sees far ahead.

55
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,360
According to my investigation,

56
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,040
the Beijian royal court once proposed

57
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:08,040
jointly mining Wanshan iron
ore near Qingzhou's border.

58
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,120
If Beijian joins forces
with the Blood Moon Society,

59
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:11,200
the consequences could be grave.

60
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,600
Your Majesty.

61
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,200
I have a plan.

62
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,840
It requires no large military campaign

63
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,000
and could eliminate the foreign threat.

64
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,080
Your Majesty.

65
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,000
Beijian has sent a marriage proposal.

66
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,520
They wish to send their
Divine Maiden for an alliance.

67
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:37,000
The Divine Maiden of Beijian
understands the stars

68
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,480
and can even divine a nation's fortunes.

69
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,760
Her status is exalted.

70
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:41,280
If this marriage takes place,

71
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,800
relations between our two
states will be secured.

72
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:45,080
Then even if the Blood Moon
Society harbors ambition,

73
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:47,240
it cannot use Beijian to stir up trouble.

74
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:48,160
Absurd!

75
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:51,280
The Empress's seat in Daning

76
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,800
cannot be occupied by a foreign woman.

77
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:55,040
Beijian masses troops at our border

78
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,640
while sending envoys to propose marriage.

79
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:59,280
Is that sincerity or a threat?

80
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,160
Your Majesty.

81
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,920
If a marriage alliance buys ten
years of peace on the border,

82
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,320
it is not a bad strategy.

83
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:07,920
Daning and Beijian already
have a trade treaty.

84
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,560
Why seek peace through marriage as well?

85
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,600
Peace between nations

86
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,520
rests on strength.

87
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,240
Your Majesty is absolutely right.

88
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:17,760
When the Emperor of Daning
appoints an Empress,

89
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:19,640
the court ministers must make nominations.

90
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:22,320
The Empress's seat has
remained vacant too long,

91
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:24,040
which has invited Beijian's designs.

92
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:26,120
I beg Your Majesty

93
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:27,800
to appoint an Empress as soon as possible

94
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:30,280
and end those barbarians' delusions.

95
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:33,040
Beijian's ruler has already
sent envoys to seek a marriage.

96
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,280
If we mishandle this,

97
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,320
it may bring trouble to the border.

98
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,760
My two ministers, enough arguing.

99
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,360
I will consider the matter carefully.

100
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,040
Meng Tinghui.

101
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:46,360
About the memorial you just submitted,

102
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:48,520
I still have one comment.

103
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,440
Take a look

104
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:50,960
and see if anything is unclear.

105
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,680
Regarding the marriage alliance,

106
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:01,600
Beijian may be willing, but I am not.

107
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:04,360
There is only one person in my heart—you.

108
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,040
Your Majesty.

109
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:09,800
I understand.

110
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:12,120
-Your Majesty...
-Enough.

111
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,640
All of you may withdraw.

112
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,880
Meng Tinghui, you stay.

113
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:18,600
-I take my leave.
-I take my leave.

114
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:46,680
-About just now...
-Your Majesty.

115
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,760
Your Majesty.

116
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:52,000
This old servant has an
urgent matter to report.

117
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,320
What is it?

118
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:55,320
Your Majesty has been on
the throne for three years

119
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,440
and is still unmarried.

120
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,640
Appointing an Empress and consorts

121
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,800
is a matter of state and
the foundation of the realm.

122
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:02,120
Your Majesty, if you do not
want this marriage alliance,

123
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:05,120
I can select several more

124
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:06,840
noble ladies of both beauty and talent...

125
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,360
Are you trying to make me
run away from the palace?

126
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,600
I would never dare.

127
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,840
Leave.

128
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:12,760
I'll withdraw at once.

129
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,520
Were you angry just now?

130
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,000
Jealous, perhaps?

131
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:29,080
Of course not.

132
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:31,440
Your Majesty is ruler of the realm.

133
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:33,760
If I grew jealous of every woman you met,

134
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:35,400
I fear I would overstep my place.

135
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:42,240
You are overstepping.

136
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:44,920
But I like it.

137
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:50,840
Your Majesty.

138
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,720
Your Majesty.

139
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:55,720
What are you afraid of?

140
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,440
The courage you had that day
in Wangxian Valley—

141
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,760
where did it go?

142
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,760
Your Majesty.

143
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,400
Please restrain yourself.

144
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:36,600
Zhili.

145
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:38,640
I'm going to Qingzhou on
an imperial assignment,

146
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,680
not being exiled to the far north.

147
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:40,920
If you pack this much for me,

148
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,240
won't people laugh at me?

149
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,720
Qingzhou is bitterly cold.

150
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:46,920
Frost in the sixth month
is nothing unusual.

151
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:48,360
Brother.

152
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:51,720
You always care more about
appearances than warmth.

153
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,320
But this trip is for serious business.

154
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:55,560
Forget looking elegant for once.

155
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:57,200
Taking care of yourself matters most.

156
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:59,000
You've thought of everything.

157
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,120
You're starting to sound
like my older sister.

158
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:01,720
Fine by me.

159
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:03,440
Then call me Sister from now on.

160
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,960
No, thanks. Anian is your
one good little brother.

161
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:08,760
I wouldn't dare compete with him.

162
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,960
Don't take anything else out.

163
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:12,680
I'll see how Father's
meal is coming along.

164
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:13,720
I'll call you when it's ready.

165
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,600
Brother.

166
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,720
Let your little brother
say one more thing.

167
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:26,560
The border is nothing like the capital.

168
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:28,200
You'll be out there alone.

169
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:30,080
Open attacks are easy to dodge;
hidden ones are not.

170
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:31,000
So

171
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,840
I prepared this especially for you.

172
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,680
You must wear it at all times.

173
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:39,760
Fine. Put it in for me.

174
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:41,840
I know you too well.

175
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:43,680
You agree readily to my face,

176
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:45,320
then forget the moment you turn around.

177
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:46,560
Today,

178
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:48,080
I'm putting it on you myself.

179
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:50,640
Mind your manners.

180
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:53,400
I'm already spoken for.

181
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,800
I have to preserve my virtue for Fuzhi.

182
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:56,520
Fine.

183
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:59,280
Spoken for, preserving your virtue.

184
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,680
I'll leave it right here.

185
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,280
Anian.

186
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,520
Before I leave,

187
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,760
there are some things I need to tell you.

188
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:13,680
I don't know when I'll return.

189
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:15,200
What worries me most

190
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,360
is this family.

191
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,160
Father and Mother are getting old.

192
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,120
Zhili is still unmarried.

193
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,880
You must take good care of them for me,

194
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,400
especially Zhili.

195
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,640
Don't worry, Brother.

196
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,920
I'll protect her.

197
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:28,160
Protection alone isn't enough.

198
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:30,240
Those feelings you have for Zhili...

199
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:31,440
I noticed them long ago.

200
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:32,360
I...

201
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,920
You don't need to hide anything from me.

202
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:43,080
Zhili grew up with you from childhood.

203
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:44,680
The way she cares about you

204
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:47,160
even exceeds how she cares
for me, her own brother.

205
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,280
I can see that too.

206
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,720
You brat, you're no innocent.

207
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,720
You set your sights on our Zhili long ago.

208
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:54,480
But

209
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:56,840
if I entrust Zhili to you,

210
00:11:58,680 --> 00:11:59,840
I can rest easy.

211
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,320
I have told her how I feel.

212
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,320
But in her heart...

213
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:12,440
Don't worry.

214
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,280
Whatever there is between
her and the Right Chancellor

215
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:16,160
is no more than a student's

216
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,920
admiration and respect for her teacher.

217
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,240
It is not romantic love.

218
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,520
Even you know about this?

219
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,400
There are some things

220
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,360
I wanted to tell her myself.

221
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,400
But somehow,

222
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:30,080
between brother and sister,

223
00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:31,560
some subjects are hard to bring up.

224
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,400
While I'm away,

225
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:36,040
you must keep an eye on her for me.

226
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:37,720
Don't let the Right Chancellor mislead her

227
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:38,640
and lead her astray.

228
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,480
Because of the Right Chancellor,

229
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:42,760
we've had many arguments.

230
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:45,120
Even now...

231
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:46,800
she keeps avoiding me.

232
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:48,520
You, of all people,

233
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,560
are carefree and unrestrained all day,

234
00:12:50,640 --> 00:12:52,440
yet around Zhili you're
always so cautious.

235
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,640
You value her too much,

236
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:56,320
so you overthink every move.

237
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:57,960
When it comes to love,

238
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:00,560
you need a little reckless courage.

239
00:13:00,640 --> 00:13:02,040
Otherwise, once you miss your chance,

240
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,280
you may regret it for life.

241
00:13:05,640 --> 00:13:06,640
Besides,

242
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,800
you're young and in your prime,

243
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:10,120
with a bright future ahead.

244
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,320
How are you inferior to
the Right Chancellor?

245
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:13,000
Even if we take the worst-case view,

246
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,480
you're more than twenty
years younger than he is.

247
00:13:15,280 --> 00:13:16,120
As for my future brother-in-law,

248
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:17,520
you're the only one I'll accept.

249
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,120
I understand.

250
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,360
When it comes to Zhili,

251
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:21,760
I won't yield even an inch.

252
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:33,400
That must be Father's...

253
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:34,360
sweet-and-sour ribs.

254
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,320
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

255
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,240
Stop pushing me.

256
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:39,200
His Majesty has permitted
Bofeng Tavern to reopen.

257
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:41,240
Fine dishes await every guest.

258
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:43,440
All wine is half price.

259
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:45,320
-Please come in!
-Please come in!

260
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:47,520
Sir, right this way.

261
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,560
The Blood Moon Society
operates in secrecy.

262
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:53,480
On this trip,

263
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:54,840
you must be extremely careful.

264
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,080
If anything unusual happens,

265
00:13:56,160 --> 00:13:57,520
send word back immediately.

266
00:13:58,920 --> 00:13:59,960
I have the imperial order with me.

267
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:01,160
Your Majesty needn't worry.

268
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:06,400
Director Meng even made
pastries herself to see me off.

269
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:08,160
I'm truly moved by such affection.

270
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:11,040
Who said they were made for you?

271
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:13,960
Director Meng and I
were chatting last night

272
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,640
and mentioned this thousand-layer cake.

273
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:17,000
Last night?

274
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,760
I entered the palace last night

275
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:21,000
to report my itinerary to Your Majesty.

276
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,360
I never saw Director Meng there.

277
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:25,360
Lord Shen,

278
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:27,280
isn't Fuzhi here to see you off?

279
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,200
Zhizhi.

280
00:14:28,280 --> 00:14:29,880
I brought some loose silver and banknotes.

281
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:31,880
-Zhizhi.
-And withdrawal seals for Yan banks.

282
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:34,600
Zhizhi, you're far too good to me.

283
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:36,840
We'll have a long, tiring journey.

284
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:38,360
We can't exactly make
ourselves suffer, can we?

285
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,480
We?

286
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,200
Zhizhi.

287
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,920
I'm going this time on official business.

288
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:44,000
What a coincidence, then.

289
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,840
His Majesty has allowed
Bofeng Tavern to reopen.

290
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,600
Merchants from every prefecture
have sent calling cards.

291
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:49,480
The head of the Qingzhou
Merchants' Guild sent three.

292
00:14:49,560 --> 00:14:52,200
I have to inspect things there in person.

293
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:57,800
Zhizhi.

294
00:14:57,880 --> 00:15:00,080
I'm going on a confidential mission.

295
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,480
You can use visiting relatives
as a pretext

296
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:02,880
and travel with Miss Yan.

297
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,840
it will help conceal your movements.

298
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:06,680
-Wonderful!
-Wonderful!

299
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:08,960
Zhizhi, let's switch
to a roomier carriage.

300
00:15:09,040 --> 00:15:09,960
We'll line it with snow-fox blankets.

301
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:11,400
and bring your favorite pastries.

302
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:13,480
Zhizhi, you're so thoughtful.

303
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:15,200
Zhizhi, you're still the best.

304
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:17,840
No, no. You're much better.

305
00:15:18,400 --> 00:15:19,680
No, you are.

306
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:22,760
What are you two doing?

307
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,000
What are you doing?

308
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:29,600
I'm returning to the palace now.

309
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:31,760
I can see you part of the way. Let's go.

310
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:34,120
I also need to return to
the Office on business.

311
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,200
-Let's go.
-Wait.

312
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:37,440
The palace and the Office

313
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:39,680
are in opposite directions...

314
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:42,600
Zhizhi, let's go.

315
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:43,640
Don't forget your big sword.

316
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,320
Mengmeng, take care of
yourself while I'm gone.

317
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:46,440
And remember to write to me.

318
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:49,360
Zhizhi, when I return,
I'll follow every formal betrothal rite

319
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,760
and come to your home to
ask for your hand myself.

320
00:15:53,680 --> 00:15:54,960
At the execution ground that day,

321
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:56,280
Gu Qin looked uneasy.

322
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,800
He must have something to hide.

323
00:15:58,600 --> 00:15:59,880
Today, I want to see

324
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,880
whether that cat's-eye
pendant is really here.

325
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:03,320
Madam Chancellor,

326
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:05,120
we're only trying to uncover the truth.

327
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:07,360
If your spirit can hear us,

328
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:09,400
please haunt the true
murderer and claim his life.

329
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:12,960
Spirits above and spirits below,

330
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:14,400
ancestors, protect us.

331
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:15,640
Let this coffin open without trouble.

332
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:16,880
Madam Chancellor,

333
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:17,880
forgive us.

334
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:19,600
Spirits above...

335
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:20,920
We'll run out of time if we delay.

336
00:16:50,520 --> 00:16:51,800
Forgive us...

337
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,560
Someone's coming, my lord.

338
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:01,600
Just one last step. Hurry and search.

339
00:17:09,600 --> 00:17:10,720
Quickly.

340
00:18:05,280 --> 00:18:06,960
Chancellor, this...

341
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:30,240
Starting tomorrow,

342
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:32,080
send more monks to chant sutras for Madam.

343
00:18:32,160 --> 00:18:33,800
They are to chant around the clock

344
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:38,360
so no wandering spirits

345
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,520
disturb her.

346
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:41,360
Yes.

347
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:27,200
Your Majesty.

348
00:19:27,280 --> 00:19:30,280
The Right Chancellor claimed his cat's-eye
pendant was buried with his late wife.

349
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:32,120
But Yin Qing and I opened
the coffin to inspect it

350
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:33,040
and found no trace of it.

351
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:35,440
More suspicious still,

352
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:37,040
he sent men to check the
grave that very night.

353
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:38,800
That proves he has something to hide.

354
00:19:41,240 --> 00:19:43,360
The Right Chancellor's act
of being a devoted husband

355
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,600
is quite convincing.

356
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:49,320
But even if we expose his lie now,

357
00:19:49,920 --> 00:19:50,960
we still have no hard evidence.

358
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:53,440
He was the hidden protector
behind Ling Yunfei.

359
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:55,360
We still cannot touch him.

360
00:19:55,440 --> 00:19:56,520
I considered that too.

361
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:58,760
If I confront him,

362
00:19:58,840 --> 00:20:00,320
he can simply claim the cat's-eye pendant

363
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,840
was stolen by grave robbers.

364
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:03,160
Then we still couldn't do anything to him.

365
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:05,760
I want to use purging corruption
from court as our pretext.

366
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:07,360
On the surface, we'll
investigate all officials.

367
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:10,920
In truth, we'll focus on clues
tied to the Right Chancellor.

368
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:12,280
What I want

369
00:20:12,360 --> 00:20:14,000
is not merely to expose one lie,

370
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:15,960
but to make sure that in this court,

371
00:20:16,040 --> 00:20:17,320
no one dares deceive the Emperor again.

372
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:21,040
Your Majesty is killing
two birds with one stone.

373
00:20:25,080 --> 00:20:25,920
What happened to your hand?

374
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:30,000
I may have knocked it
while opening the coffin.

375
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:31,400
It's nothing.

376
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:33,240
Is the Light Cavalry I assigned
you merely for show?

377
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:35,120
For something like entering
a tomb and opening a coffin,

378
00:20:35,200 --> 00:20:37,440
only Yin Qing was
suitable to accompany me.

379
00:20:37,520 --> 00:20:38,560
Why mobilize the Light Cavalry?

380
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:40,440
I'll apply medicine for you.

381
00:20:40,520 --> 00:20:41,400
Your Majesty.

382
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:49,840
Your Majesty.

383
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,360
What is it?

384
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:54,520
I saw you staying up late reading again.

385
00:20:54,600 --> 00:20:55,920
Your health has been poor.

386
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:58,040
I'm truly worried about
Your Majesty's health.

387
00:20:58,120 --> 00:21:00,120
So I specially prepared

388
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:01,760
a bowl of restorative tonic for you.

389
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,800
Your Majesty, what is it now?

390
00:21:16,240 --> 00:21:18,360
I've been staying up late
reading these past few days,

391
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:20,240
and my health is indeed suffering.

392
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:22,880
I really do need that
restorative tonic of yours.

393
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:25,680
Your Majesty.

394
00:21:41,320 --> 00:21:43,240
Staying up late to read

395
00:21:43,320 --> 00:21:44,480
will harm Your Majesty's health.

396
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:46,160
After drinking the tonic

397
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:48,000
I prepared especially for you,

398
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:49,280
please retire early.

399
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:51,040
You may withdraw.

400
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:52,840
I take my leave.

401
00:22:13,840 --> 00:22:14,680
Has he gone?

402
00:22:15,760 --> 00:22:17,560
Lord Meng is usually so bold.

403
00:22:18,080 --> 00:22:19,280
Why so timid now?

404
00:22:19,360 --> 00:22:21,200
The moment I hear Chief
Steward You's voice,

405
00:22:21,800 --> 00:22:23,120
I panic for no reason.

406
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:24,640
Just now, Your Majesty

407
00:22:25,360 --> 00:22:26,520
was no different from me.

408
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:35,320
I rarely see you like this.

409
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:36,600
You're laughing, Your Majesty?

410
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:40,120
I've just dug up a grave
and opened a coffin,

411
00:22:40,200 --> 00:22:41,880
and now I'm hiding behind books.

412
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:43,720
We hide our private affairs

413
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:45,120
and conceal our official ones.

414
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:50,280
Being with Your Majesty

415
00:22:51,360 --> 00:22:53,480
compared with investigating
corrupt officials,

416
00:22:53,560 --> 00:22:55,040
is even more nerve-racking.

417
00:23:00,080 --> 00:23:01,880
You may be afraid,

418
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:03,400
but I like it.

419
00:23:31,280 --> 00:23:32,120
Director Meng.

420
00:23:34,360 --> 00:23:35,880
We found plenty.

421
00:23:35,960 --> 00:23:37,240
Guess what happened.

422
00:23:37,320 --> 00:23:39,080
Deputy Director Yin looks delighted.

423
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:40,600
You must have found quite a lot.

424
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,240
Let's hear it.

425
00:23:42,320 --> 00:23:44,240
Vice Minister of Revenue
Li Xin embezzled funds.

426
00:23:44,320 --> 00:23:46,120
He put all his ill-gotten
wealth in his wife's hands.

427
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:48,000
But behind his back,

428
00:23:48,080 --> 00:23:50,960
she kept several young lovers.

429
00:23:51,040 --> 00:23:53,200
I'll surrender this mansion,
the only property I acquired illegally,

430
00:23:53,280 --> 00:23:54,640
to the Office immediately.

431
00:23:54,720 --> 00:23:56,240
As you can see, the place is empty.

432
00:23:56,320 --> 00:23:58,640
I haven't hidden a single
coin of the stolen money.

433
00:23:58,720 --> 00:24:00,240
Lord Yin, surely you can see...

434
00:24:01,800 --> 00:24:03,080
-Husband!
-You wretch!

435
00:24:03,160 --> 00:24:04,480
-Husband!
-You used my money

436
00:24:04,560 --> 00:24:05,480
to keep these beasts!

437
00:24:05,560 --> 00:24:06,880
Lord Li, this has nothing to do with me!

438
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:09,440
-It has nothing to do with me!
-You dared become her kept man?

439
00:24:09,520 --> 00:24:10,560
There's more.

440
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:12,000
The wife of Director Zhang
from the Ministry of Justice

441
00:24:12,080 --> 00:24:13,920
filed a formal complaint with the Office.

442
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:16,600
Her husband keeps twelve mistresses.

443
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:19,000
Apparently, more than half of them

444
00:24:19,080 --> 00:24:20,600
are women from Wanxiang House,

445
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:22,600
sent by Liu Ruyan to serve Director Zhang.

446
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:24,600
They only care about
his money, not the man,

447
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:26,080
and get along like real sisters.

448
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:27,400
As long as there's enough money,

449
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:28,920
there's no need to fight over him.

450
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:31,320
Then there's Hanlin Compiler Chen Jingyi.

451
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:34,040
She's educated, courteous and gentle,

452
00:24:34,120 --> 00:24:36,040
and highly regarded by the
senior Secretariat officials.

453
00:24:37,040 --> 00:24:38,920
How could she be involved
in such a scandal?

454
00:24:39,720 --> 00:24:40,760
I'm nearly seventy.

455
00:24:40,840 --> 00:24:43,200
How could I do anything so vile?

456
00:24:43,280 --> 00:24:46,080
This is outrageous!

457
00:24:53,680 --> 00:24:54,520
Don't be afraid.

458
00:24:55,600 --> 00:24:57,800
If you don't speak up now,
you may never get another chance.

459
00:25:00,400 --> 00:25:02,240
Don't be afraid. Speak up.

460
00:25:07,040 --> 00:25:08,480
It was you.

461
00:25:08,560 --> 00:25:10,720
You used your position
to make indecent advances toward me.

462
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:12,680
Then you threatened my career

463
00:25:12,760 --> 00:25:13,800
to force me into silence,

464
00:25:14,840 --> 00:25:18,080
saying you'd make sure
I had no place in the capital.

465
00:25:19,360 --> 00:25:20,480
I believe among all of you

466
00:25:20,560 --> 00:25:22,520
there must be others like me

467
00:25:22,600 --> 00:25:25,360
female officials who have suffered
at Academician Jiang's hands.

468
00:25:25,440 --> 00:25:27,440
Will you stand with me?

469
00:25:38,680 --> 00:25:40,160
If everyone stays silent,

470
00:25:41,280 --> 00:25:42,160
we allow this kind of

471
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:44,200
sanctimonious predator to walk free.

472
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:45,920
Then

473
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:47,920
more women will suffer in the future.

474
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:49,920
As female officials,

475
00:25:50,480 --> 00:25:51,760
our path is difficult enough already.

476
00:25:52,840 --> 00:25:55,000
We cannot let this vile
conduct spread unchecked.

477
00:25:56,600 --> 00:25:57,440
It was you.

478
00:25:57,520 --> 00:25:59,760
You abused your position
to make indecent advances toward me.

479
00:26:00,640 --> 00:26:01,640
Yes, you.

480
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:02,920
You did it to me too.

481
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:04,440
You violated me too.

482
00:26:04,520 --> 00:26:05,360
Take him away.

483
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:07,080
Why are you arresting me?

484
00:26:07,160 --> 00:26:09,280
-Move.
-Why are you arresting me?

485
00:26:09,360 --> 00:26:10,480
We also discovered

486
00:26:10,560 --> 00:26:12,440
the Ministry of Personnel
has been selling offices.

487
00:26:12,520 --> 00:26:13,880
For now, however,

488
00:26:13,960 --> 00:26:15,880
it appears to be the secret work
of lower-ranking officials

489
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:17,720
and has not yet implicated
senior ministers.

490
00:26:23,720 --> 00:26:25,520
All Personnel Ministry officials
involved in selling posts

491
00:26:25,600 --> 00:26:27,160
are suspended immediately
pending investigation.

492
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:28,640
Take them away.

493
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:30,200
-What's going on?
-Ah...

494
00:26:30,280 --> 00:26:31,480
Move.

495
00:26:31,560 --> 00:26:33,280
-Move! Hurry!
-Why are you arresting me?

496
00:26:33,360 --> 00:26:36,480
So far, we've only caught a few small fry.

497
00:26:36,560 --> 00:26:38,920
The big fish behind Ling Yunfei

498
00:26:39,680 --> 00:26:41,120
is still lurking beneath the surface.

499
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:43,160
We need to stir up this entire pond

500
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:45,560
until it's completely turned upside down.

501
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:47,720
Only in muddy water...

502
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:49,760
can we catch the fish.

503
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:56,600
I, Vice Minister of Works Pan Wenhai,

504
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:57,760
on behalf of the assembled ministers,

505
00:26:57,840 --> 00:27:01,040
impeach Meng Tinghui of the Office
for exceeding her authority

506
00:27:01,760 --> 00:27:04,440
and prying deeply into the private affairs
of senior court officials,

507
00:27:04,520 --> 00:27:07,360
causing outrage throughout the court

508
00:27:07,440 --> 00:27:08,680
and widespread fear.

509
00:27:10,120 --> 00:27:12,680
It is rare to see all
my ministers so united.

510
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:14,320
I am greatly pleased.

511
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:16,760
If the Office has truly
acted so outrageously,

512
00:27:16,840 --> 00:27:19,440
you may report its misconduct directly.

513
00:27:19,520 --> 00:27:20,960
Expose any corruption

514
00:27:21,040 --> 00:27:22,040
or abuse of law committed there.

515
00:27:22,920 --> 00:27:24,400
I will show no leniency.

516
00:27:31,360 --> 00:27:33,560
Do any of you have
anything else to report?

517
00:27:43,760 --> 00:27:46,000
My lords, don't be in
such a hurry to leave.

518
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:50,240
The tea at the Office is getting cold.

519
00:27:51,760 --> 00:27:52,600
Please.

520
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:54,720
We haven't broken any laws.

521
00:27:54,800 --> 00:27:56,160
How can you detain us at will?

522
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:57,200
-Exactly.
-Right.

523
00:27:57,280 --> 00:27:58,480
What gives you the right to arrest us?

524
00:27:58,560 --> 00:28:01,280
Because you fabricated accusations

525
00:28:01,360 --> 00:28:02,680
and maliciously impeached the Office.

526
00:28:02,760 --> 00:28:04,480
I can therefore detain you

527
00:28:04,560 --> 00:28:05,640
for twelve hours on charges
of false accusation.

528
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:07,320
-Take them away.
-Yes.

529
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:10,280
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

530
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:14,040
Your Majesty, please see the truth!

531
00:28:14,120 --> 00:28:15,280
Your Majesty!

532
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:17,680
Meng Tinghui twists right and wrong

533
00:28:17,760 --> 00:28:18,920
and frames loyal officials!

534
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:20,600
-Your Majesty!
-Move.

535
00:28:21,280 --> 00:28:22,120
Quickly.

536
00:28:23,520 --> 00:28:24,600
Meng Tinghui!

537
00:28:24,680 --> 00:28:27,200
What right have you to detain us here?

538
00:28:27,280 --> 00:28:29,200
-Exactly!
-Yes, why?

539
00:28:29,280 --> 00:28:31,200
Why are you holding us here?

540
00:28:31,280 --> 00:28:32,120
Witch!

541
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:34,120
Unless you kill me,

542
00:28:34,200 --> 00:28:36,240
I'll submit a memorial every day

543
00:28:36,320 --> 00:28:37,680
to impeach a treacherous
official like you!

544
00:28:37,760 --> 00:28:39,560
-Exactly!
-Yes!

545
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:42,160
You are the Daji of this court,

546
00:28:42,880 --> 00:28:44,080
a curse without end!

547
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:46,520
The court's Daji, a curse without end!

548
00:28:46,600 --> 00:28:47,480
A curse without end!

549
00:28:47,560 --> 00:28:49,640
-Witch!
-Get out of the court!

550
00:28:49,720 --> 00:28:52,000
I refuse to serve alongside you.

551
00:29:00,560 --> 00:29:03,000
I merely invited all you ministers

552
00:29:03,080 --> 00:29:05,200
to the Office for a cup of tea.

553
00:29:06,520 --> 00:29:08,040
Why get so worked up?

554
00:29:08,520 --> 00:29:10,560
We will never drink tea served by

555
00:29:10,640 --> 00:29:11,960
a treacherous official like you!

556
00:29:12,040 --> 00:29:13,680
-Exactly!
-Right!

557
00:29:13,760 --> 00:29:15,400
We won't drink your tea!

558
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:17,360
Witch, get out of the court!

559
00:29:17,440 --> 00:29:19,480
During last autumn's
provincial examination,

560
00:29:19,560 --> 00:29:21,920
Academician Lin accepted
bribes from candidates

561
00:29:22,560 --> 00:29:24,840
and altered thirteen exam papers.

562
00:29:24,920 --> 00:29:26,440
Three of those candidates

563
00:29:26,520 --> 00:29:27,640
could barely write a coherent sentence,

564
00:29:27,720 --> 00:29:30,240
while true scholars who
studied for ten years failed.

565
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:32,560
One even coughed blood
and collapsed on the spot.

566
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:33,960
Send him to the Court of Judicial Review

567
00:29:34,840 --> 00:29:35,840
for punishment according to law.

568
00:29:35,920 --> 00:29:36,800
Meng Tinghui!

569
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:38,400
You... you're using public office
for a private vendetta!

570
00:29:38,480 --> 00:29:40,080
Yin Qing.

571
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:42,000
-I demand to see His Majesty!
-Director Meng.

572
00:29:42,080 --> 00:29:43,440
-Meng Tinghui!
-During the heavy rains early this year,

573
00:29:44,040 --> 00:29:46,000
Minister of Works Pan Wenhai

574
00:29:46,080 --> 00:29:47,880
used repairs to the
river dikes as a pretext

575
00:29:47,960 --> 00:29:50,800
to embezzle nearly 100,000 taels
of disaster-relief funds.

576
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:52,280
Six downstream villages were destroyed,

577
00:29:52,360 --> 00:29:54,320
with countless people killed or injured.

578
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:57,240
Yet only three days after the disaster,

579
00:29:57,320 --> 00:29:58,880
he purchased a thousand
mu of prime farmland.

580
00:29:59,760 --> 00:30:01,840
-A thou...
-A thousand mu?

581
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:03,120
Nonsense!

582
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:05,720
-Utter lies!
-Here is the evidence of his embezzlement.

583
00:30:11,880 --> 00:30:12,720
You...

584
00:30:12,800 --> 00:30:14,000
You even dared steal
disaster-relief money?

585
00:30:14,800 --> 00:30:16,600
Send him and the evidence
to the Ministry of Justice.

586
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:18,600
Remember to remind the Minister

587
00:30:19,160 --> 00:30:22,440
that under the Laws of Daning,
this case carries the highest penalty.

588
00:30:23,280 --> 00:30:24,480
I've been framed!

589
00:30:24,560 --> 00:30:25,960
Nonsense!

590
00:30:26,040 --> 00:30:27,560
Utter nonsense!

591
00:30:27,640 --> 00:30:28,480
Lord Pan.

592
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:32,840
Next.

593
00:30:33,640 --> 00:30:34,760
Meng Tinghui!

594
00:30:35,360 --> 00:30:37,080
You abuse public office for private ends

595
00:30:37,160 --> 00:30:38,720
and attack anyone outside your faction.

596
00:30:38,800 --> 00:30:40,240
His Majesty must have lost his senses

597
00:30:40,320 --> 00:30:42,120
to place such favor in you alone!

598
00:30:42,200 --> 00:30:43,440
-Exactly!
-Exactly!

599
00:30:43,520 --> 00:30:45,160
-Witch!
-Why?

600
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:46,360
Silence!

601
00:31:16,160 --> 00:31:17,400
His Majesty's decisions

602
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:18,600
are not yours to criticize.

603
00:31:19,520 --> 00:31:21,840
The Right Chancellor himself
honors the Office with a visit.

604
00:31:21,920 --> 00:31:22,840
Forgive us for not welcoming you sooner.

605
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:24,840
I hope you'll pardon us.

606
00:31:28,600 --> 00:31:30,320
Everyone says the Office
serves terrible tea.

607
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:32,680
I thought I'd come taste it myself.

608
00:31:34,640 --> 00:31:35,480
Director Meng.

609
00:31:37,200 --> 00:31:39,000
Would you spare me a cup?

610
00:31:48,320 --> 00:31:49,520
Right Chancellor.

611
00:31:49,600 --> 00:31:50,440
Please.

612
00:31:55,440 --> 00:31:57,360
The Office has recently
been purging corruption.

613
00:31:57,440 --> 00:31:59,080
As head of the civil officials,

614
00:31:59,840 --> 00:32:01,440
and one whom the realm flatters
as a virtuous chancellor,

615
00:32:02,480 --> 00:32:04,160
I should naturally set
an example for the court

616
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:05,680
and cooperate willingly
with your investigation.

617
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:08,880
Right Chancellor.

618
00:32:08,960 --> 00:32:11,600
I heard Pan Wenhai and Academician Lin

619
00:32:11,680 --> 00:32:12,640
were both your students.

620
00:32:12,720 --> 00:32:14,040
Director Meng, mind your words.

621
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:19,000
We are all servants of the court.

622
00:32:19,080 --> 00:32:21,400
We receive the sovereign's salary
and must serve him faithfully.

623
00:32:22,040 --> 00:32:24,840
Even if close followers or
old friends break the law,

624
00:32:25,800 --> 00:32:26,960
I will never shield them.

625
00:32:29,200 --> 00:32:31,200
The Right Chancellor is truly principled.

626
00:32:31,760 --> 00:32:33,280
Speaking of close followers and old ties,

627
00:32:33,840 --> 00:32:35,760
does the Gu family have
any collateral branches?

628
00:32:38,280 --> 00:32:39,800
I was born into a humble family.

629
00:32:39,880 --> 00:32:41,520
I am the Gu family's only male heir

630
00:32:41,600 --> 00:32:42,480
and the one who restored its standing.

631
00:32:42,560 --> 00:32:44,360
Director Meng may
investigate as she pleases.

632
00:32:44,440 --> 00:32:47,000
I only ask that you enforce
the law impartially,

633
00:32:47,080 --> 00:32:47,960
neither framing the innocent
nor sparing the guilty.

634
00:32:48,040 --> 00:32:50,880
I am willing to let Director
Meng's investigation

635
00:32:50,960 --> 00:32:51,800
prove my loyalty and integrity.

636
00:32:51,880 --> 00:32:53,640
Right Chancellor,

637
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:56,040
are you truly not worried
about what we may uncover?

638
00:32:56,120 --> 00:32:58,600
I have always conducted myself uprightly.

639
00:32:58,680 --> 00:32:59,600
I fear no investigation.

640
00:33:00,240 --> 00:33:02,480
These are the account books
for my salary over the years.

641
00:33:03,840 --> 00:33:04,960
Please examine them as you wish.

642
00:33:06,200 --> 00:33:08,280
Since the Right Chancellor is so open,

643
00:33:09,120 --> 00:33:10,720
you must surely be beyond suspicion.

644
00:33:11,360 --> 00:33:14,080
so there's no need to investigate further.

645
00:33:15,160 --> 00:33:17,800
The Right Chancellor once
helped advance my career.

646
00:33:17,880 --> 00:33:19,840
I have complete faith that he is

647
00:33:19,920 --> 00:33:21,360
honest and incorruptible.

648
00:33:22,240 --> 00:33:23,080
Come.

649
00:33:34,440 --> 00:33:36,840
Who says the Office's tea is bad?

650
00:33:37,440 --> 00:33:39,040
I find it quite delicious.

651
00:33:41,000 --> 00:33:42,840
My lords, remain calm.

652
00:33:42,920 --> 00:33:44,920
Come and taste the tea with me.

653
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:47,000
We are all colleagues.

654
00:33:47,800 --> 00:33:50,120
We should fully cooperate
with Director Meng.

655
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:51,400
-Yes.
-Yes.

656
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:58,920
That Meng Tinghui is like a rabid dog.

657
00:33:59,000 --> 00:34:00,960
She's thrown all Six
Ministries into chaos.

658
00:34:01,480 --> 00:34:02,920
Pan Wenhai and Academician Lin

659
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:04,640
are already panicking.

660
00:34:04,720 --> 00:34:05,960
If she keeps digging like this, then...

661
00:34:06,040 --> 00:34:07,920
Since Meng Tinghui wants
to purge the court,

662
00:34:08,480 --> 00:34:10,640
I should naturally cooperate.

663
00:34:14,960 --> 00:34:15,840
Perhaps...

664
00:34:16,880 --> 00:34:18,280
we should give her a few heads.

665
00:34:21,720 --> 00:34:22,560
My lord.

666
00:34:22,640 --> 00:34:24,640
They have been utterly loyal to you.

667
00:34:24,720 --> 00:34:26,400
If the fishing net is cast too tightly,

668
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:28,560
you must let a few
small fish slip through.

669
00:34:28,640 --> 00:34:29,640
Lord Pan

670
00:34:29,720 --> 00:34:31,400
is especially fond of buying
land and estates, isn't he?

671
00:34:33,800 --> 00:34:35,360
Have someone leak that to Meng Tinghui.

672
00:34:36,040 --> 00:34:37,600
How much she manages to uncover

673
00:34:39,520 --> 00:34:41,200
will depend on her ability.

674
00:34:49,440 --> 00:34:50,920
Right Chancellor, when it comes
to the Office's work,

675
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:52,400
you have given us such strong support.

676
00:34:53,000 --> 00:34:54,840
I am deeply grateful.

677
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:57,720
In that case,

678
00:34:57,800 --> 00:34:59,080
I won't impose any longer.

679
00:34:59,160 --> 00:35:00,720
Director Meng, if you
encounter any difficulty,

680
00:35:01,240 --> 00:35:03,640
send someone to my residence at any time.

681
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:07,440
Director Meng, I'll see my teacher out.

682
00:35:13,240 --> 00:35:14,440
Director.

683
00:35:14,560 --> 00:35:16,720
The Right Chancellor
clearly came prepared.

684
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:18,120
How should we respond?

685
00:35:18,200 --> 00:35:19,680
The more he puts on this performance,

686
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:21,200
the more guilty he looks.

687
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:23,480
Since he wants to stage this play,

688
00:35:23,560 --> 00:35:25,040
we may as well play along.

689
00:35:25,120 --> 00:35:26,760
Gather and organize

690
00:35:26,840 --> 00:35:28,400
every case file concerning
the Right Chancellor.

691
00:35:28,480 --> 00:35:30,080
That old fox

692
00:35:30,560 --> 00:35:32,520
wants to use me to hold
up a mirror of virtue.

693
00:35:32,600 --> 00:35:34,400
I'd like to see

694
00:35:35,320 --> 00:35:37,840
whether that mirror reveals the truth

695
00:35:37,920 --> 00:35:40,040
or the blood staining his hands.

696
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:52,200
The Blood Moon hangs high.

697
00:36:52,280 --> 00:36:53,840
The Black Bird returns.

698
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:55,520
The Blood Moon hangs high.

699
00:36:55,600 --> 00:36:57,040
The Black Bird returns.

700
00:36:59,280 --> 00:37:00,840
A secret letter from Mr. Shangguan.

701
00:37:00,920 --> 00:37:03,640
Although we failed to take
Ying Gua's life this time,

702
00:37:03,720 --> 00:37:05,360
the Princess is now highly valued

703
00:37:05,440 --> 00:37:06,400
and risen swiftly through the ranks.

704
00:37:06,480 --> 00:37:08,040
May Heaven bless Zhongwan.

705
00:37:08,120 --> 00:37:09,920
May we reclaim our homeland.

706
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:13,360
That dog Emperor seems unwilling
to form a marriage alliance with Beijian.

707
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:15,000
Our Black Feather Guard has
successfully intercepted

708
00:37:15,080 --> 00:37:16,760
thirty thousand shi of
Daning military grain.

709
00:37:16,840 --> 00:37:18,400
Heaven has handed us
the perfect opportunity.

710
00:37:18,480 --> 00:37:21,720
In three days, I will go to Beijian myself

711
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:23,000
to forge an alliance.

712
00:37:26,600 --> 00:37:29,560
Where the Blood Moon and
Black Feather blades point,

713
00:37:30,040 --> 00:37:33,200
Daning's realm will tremble.

714
00:37:33,280 --> 00:37:34,640
May Heaven bless Zhongwan.

715
00:37:34,720 --> 00:37:36,160
May we reclaim our homeland.

716
00:37:36,240 --> 00:37:38,040
May Heaven bless Zhongwan.

717
00:37:38,120 --> 00:37:39,360
May we reclaim our homeland.

718
00:38:51,720 --> 00:38:53,760
Yao'er, come catch me!

719
00:38:54,480 --> 00:38:55,760
Come on! Come on!

720
00:38:56,600 --> 00:38:58,200
Yao'er, come catch me!

721
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:00,400
Brother Shangguan!

722
00:39:01,080 --> 00:39:02,360
Brother Shangguan!

723
00:39:03,160 --> 00:39:04,760
Brother Shangguan!

724
00:39:05,800 --> 00:39:07,440
Brother Shangguan!

725
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:11,320
Brother Shangguan!

726
00:39:11,400 --> 00:39:13,560
Where did you go?

727
00:39:13,640 --> 00:39:15,760
Brother Shangguan!

728
00:39:16,280 --> 00:39:18,080
Brother Shangguan!

729
00:39:18,640 --> 00:39:20,760
Brother Shangguan!

730
00:39:21,520 --> 00:39:23,560
Brother Shangguan!

731
00:39:24,240 --> 00:39:25,600
Brother Shangguan!

732
00:39:26,680 --> 00:39:28,480
Brother Shangguan!

733
00:39:32,560 --> 00:39:34,280
Brother Shangguan!

734
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:20,480
Leyan.

735
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:26,800
Teacher, I've finished the painting.

736
00:40:32,320 --> 00:40:33,240
The brushwork is exquisite.

737
00:40:33,320 --> 00:40:34,280
But...

738
00:40:35,280 --> 00:40:36,280
it lacks a soul.

739
00:41:01,880 --> 00:41:03,200
Spring Comes Late.

740
00:41:03,920 --> 00:41:05,880
Last night brought tidings of spring.

741
00:41:05,960 --> 00:41:07,480
My heart rejoiced in secret,

742
00:41:07,560 --> 00:41:08,720
and quietly sent its springtime longing.

743
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:10,800
Only spring knows spring's secrets.

744
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:12,600
Is this Spring Comes Late?

745
00:41:14,160 --> 00:41:15,840
Since Lingyi died,

746
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:17,360
every day has felt

747
00:41:17,440 --> 00:41:18,480
like walking on thin ice.

748
00:41:18,560 --> 00:41:20,440
The winter has been long,

749
00:41:20,520 --> 00:41:21,880
and spring seemed impossibly far away.

750
00:41:21,960 --> 00:41:23,240
But that day,

751
00:41:23,320 --> 00:41:25,160
when I laid down the dagger before you,

752
00:41:25,560 --> 00:41:26,800
I suddenly realized

753
00:41:27,840 --> 00:41:29,080
the dead are gone,

754
00:41:29,840 --> 00:41:32,520
and the living must live for themselves.

755
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:36,640
Leyan.

756
00:41:37,440 --> 00:41:39,240
You gave me another chance at life.

757
00:41:39,800 --> 00:41:40,920
From now on,

758
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:42,520
I want to live for myself once more.

759
00:41:44,560 --> 00:41:46,720
I'm so glad you can
think this way, Teacher.

760
00:41:46,800 --> 00:41:48,320
Some time ago,

761
00:41:48,800 --> 00:41:50,320
I saw how deeply you were grieving,

762
00:41:50,400 --> 00:41:52,640
yet you still helped Director
Meng purge corruption.

763
00:41:53,400 --> 00:41:54,960
While I admired you,

764
00:41:55,040 --> 00:41:56,280
I worried about you day and night.

765
00:41:57,080 --> 00:41:58,800
So I painted this spring scene

766
00:41:59,480 --> 00:42:00,560
and wanted to give it to you.

767
00:42:07,520 --> 00:42:08,360
Leyan.

768
00:42:08,440 --> 00:42:10,200
All of this is because of you.

769
00:42:11,320 --> 00:42:12,320
Only when I'm by your side

770
00:42:12,400 --> 00:42:14,440
can I truly be myself.

771
00:42:15,800 --> 00:42:17,480
I know teacher and student
must observe proper boundaries.

772
00:42:17,560 --> 00:42:19,840
The road ahead will be full of obstacles.

773
00:42:21,960 --> 00:42:23,240
But if I remain steadfast...

774
00:42:23,880 --> 00:42:25,040
Leyan.

775
00:42:25,120 --> 00:42:26,600
Would you be willing, for my sake,

776
00:42:27,520 --> 00:42:28,600
to be brave just once?
